ecame  ridiculously powerful now nightmare then  infiltrates eternity's dreams and  attacks him from within to subject him  to whatever nightmare he chooses in  doing so nightmare was actually able to  manipulate eternity's dreams to affect  the world this is because eternity is a  cosmic abstract that represents  everything in existence in the universe  so his dreams quite literally become  reality and this is probably nightmare's  second greatest feat because eternity is  an extremely powerful entity so the fact  that nightmare could effectively attack  him indicates an insane level of power  furthermore if doctor strange had not  been successful in waking eternity from  his slumber nightmare could have caused  the entire universe to just stop  existing now in a truly bizarre story by  paul cornell called fantastic four true  story we saw another absurd display of  nightmare's powers as he's able to use  his ability to invade the human  subconscious to infiltrate the world of  fictional stories which reside in the  minds of humans now nightmare's effect  on the realm of fiction is felt by susan  storm who basically feels imagination  and creativity disappearing from the  world ultimately leaving her in a state  of depression now she starts to realize  as she goes to read to her daughter  valeria that both she and her daughter  are afraid to read so to understand why  people are afraid of fiction the  fantastic four build a machine they call  jasper to travel to the realm of fiction  where they find that nightmare is  building an army to overtake the  entirety of fiction now while this is  really strange at least even just for a  comic book story the fact that nightmare  could corrupt an entire universe that  exists beyond the confines of the marvel  universe and is vast enough to encompass  all of fiction shows us nightmare's  ability to invade the minds of others is  insanely strong and can be used to alter  reality now nightmare was also able to  physically influence all magic users on  earth including all the ghost riders  scarlet witch magic dracula and even  doctor strange and like many of the  demonic entities in the marvel universe  he is even more powerful in his own  realm where he's proven to be more  powerful than hercules ajax from the  eternals amatsu mikabashi who a lot of  you guys know as the chaos king and an  elder god named a tomb nightmare has  also been able to create his own plane  of existence and was able to gain the  upper hand while battling both all  father thor and loki at the same time  and most recently and i consider this to  probably be just the greatest most  insane thing that nightmares ever pulled  off in the 2020 anthology series that  was simply titled marvel nightmare is  able to take control of the earth and  turn it into a copy of his dream  dimension and then by doing so and  effectively feeding on the power of  everyone who's sleeping he's able to  overpower and kill all the cosmic  entities across the cosmos the  celestials eternity infinity galactus  the whole nine yards and then overpower  the living tribunal that at one point in  time nightmare was basically equal in  power to god now obviously this is not  an exhaustive list of all of nightmare's  feats but i think you get a good idea of  how powerful this guy is and i'm curious  to know if you guys think he'll actually  show up in the new doctor strange movie  or not but with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this to an end thank  you all for watching and i will catch  you all later  peace

